WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.349 --> 00:00:02.530
- I'm going to read you a bedtime story.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:05.479
It's called Goodnight Internet.

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:09.426
(harp music)

00:00:12.794 --> 00:00:16.347
- In a small pink bedroom
there was an iPhone.

00:00:16.347 --> 00:00:18.321
- And a text saying LOL.

00:00:18.321 --> 00:00:21.042
And a phone case with Harry Styles

00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:22.546
bought at the mall.

00:00:22.546 --> 00:00:24.256
- And there were Pinterest boards

00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:28.001
with lyrics from Lorde and fun makeup tips

00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:29.698
for cherry red lips.

00:00:29.698 --> 00:00:33.297
- Pictures of the fam,
triple filtered on Instagram.

00:00:33.297 --> 00:00:36.269
- Lulu Lemon pants and a cup of tea.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.427
- And a bowl of pasta,
that's also gluten free.

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:42.399
- A French Bulldog with
his own Tumblr blog.

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:46.204
- A Frozen DVD and a super hot selfie.

00:00:48.366 --> 00:00:51.490
- A set of gel nails and a sweater

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.637
from an Urban Outfitter sale.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:56.957
- Goodnight crop top, good night Shop Bop.

00:00:56.957 --> 00:00:59.256
- Goodnight Starbucks, Vanilla Cake Pop.

00:00:59.256 --> 00:01:01.396
- Goodnight Netflix.

00:01:01.396 --> 00:01:03.133
Goodnight selfie sticks.

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.130
- Goodnight creepy Tinder match.

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:07.336
Goodnight Benedict Cumberbatch.

00:01:07.336 --> 00:01:08.775
(whip sound)

00:01:08.775 --> 00:01:10.749
- Goodnight Taylor Swift.

00:01:10.749 --> 00:01:13.746
Goodnight Beyonce gif.

00:01:13.746 --> 00:01:18.746
- Goodnight Ariana Grande,
goodnight pumpkin spice latte.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.558
- Goodnight Snapchat.

00:01:23.558 --> 00:01:25.866
Goodnight Grumpy Cat.

00:01:25.866 --> 00:01:30.535
- Goodnight Candy Crush and
goodnight Sephora makeup brush.

00:01:32.049 --> 00:01:36.340
- Goodnight to my bae and
goodnight Lana Del Rey.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.749
- Goodnight Olivia Pope.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.979
Goodnight Leslie Knope.

00:01:41.979 --> 00:01:44.695
- Goodnight followers, goodnight friends.

00:01:44.695 --> 00:01:49.548
- Goodnight all my
favorite internet trends.

00:01:49.548 --> 00:01:52.799
- Goodnight laptop powered down with care.

00:01:52.799 --> 00:01:56.201
Goodnight internet users everywhere.

00:01:56.201 --> 00:02:00.204
(harp music)

00:02:06.783 --> 00:02:09.584
- What are you doing with my harp?

